## Bundled assets

### Written mushaf pages (Hafs & Warsh)
- Location: `src/assets/mushaf/*.svg`, `src/assets/mushaf-warsh/*.svg`
- Source: https://github.com/Younes12345698/pro-muslim-mushaf (Madani mushaf,
  King Fahd Glorious Qur'an Printing Complex artwork)
- License: **CC-BY-NC 4.0** — non-commercial use only. Any commercial use of
  this project requires removing or re-licensing these pages.

### Mushaf covers
- Location: `public/mushaf-cover.jpg`, `public/mushaf-cover-hafs.jpg`
- Project-provided artwork.

### Reciter photos
- Location: `public/img/*.jpg`
- Source: Wikipedia / Wikimedia Commons, downloaded by
  `scripts/fetch-reciter-photos.py` (each `CATALOG` entry in that script names
  the article a photo came from; the original license page — CC-BY, CC-BY-SA,
  or public domain — is reachable from that article).
- Each photo keeps its original free license; attribution requirements of the
  individual photo licenses apply. When no photo exists, the app falls back to
  a generated ornamental avatar (original project code).

### Adhan audio
- Location: `src/assets/adhan/voices/*.mp3`
- Several recordings come from
  https://github.com/mohsalvi/adhan-audio (that repository publishes no
  license file; the recordings are of public adhan calls).
- `baldi.mp3` (Sheikh Boulaidi — the adhan used by the official Algerian adhan
  application) and any other voice files were provided by the project owner
  from public sources.
- If you redistribute this project commercially, verify these recordings
  separately.

### Adhkar texts
- Location: `src/data/adhkar.json`
- Source: https://github.com/rn0x/Adhkar-json (no license file in that
  repository). The underlying text is from *Hisn al-Muslim* (حصن المسلم) by
  Sa'id ibn Ali ibn Wahf al-Qahtani — a widely circulated religious text.

### Fonts
- `src/assets/fonts/sura_names.woff2` — custom PUA-encoded surah-name font
  bundled with the project; verify redistribution rights before commercial use.
- **Alan Sans** (variable 300–900) and **Amiri** (400/700) are self-hosted in
  `src/assets/fonts/*.woff2` (arabic/latin/latin-ext subsets) —
  SIL Open Font License 1.1, © Google LLC / The Amiri Project.
  No requests leave to Google Fonts at runtime.

### Artwork
- `src/assets/player-frame.svg` (player mandala/frame design) and
  `src/assets/hero/mosque.jpg` (hero background) — project-provided artwork.

